  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study Freedom of Expression in Central America</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Feasibility Study Freedom of Expression in Central America</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fojo Media Institute ans&#xF6;kte om finansiering f&#xF6;r att genomf&#xF6;ra &quot;genomf&#xF6;rbarhetsstudie om potentiellt mediest&#xF6;d, i Guatemala och grannl&#xE4;nder&quot;, under det f&#xF6;rsta kvartalet 2020. Bidraget best&#xE5;r i analys av kontexten och identifiering av relevanta akt&#xF6;rer f&#xF6;r att f&#xF6;resl&#xE5; m&#xF6;jliga ing&#xE5;ngar f&#xF6;r ett framtida st&#xF6;d till medieutveckling i Centralamerika.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fojo Media Institute applied for funding to carry out the &quot;Feasibility Study on potential media support, Guatemala and neighbouring countries&quot;, during the first quarter of 2020.  The contribution consists in the analysis of the context and the identification of relevant actors to to propose possible entry points for a future support to media development in the Central American Region.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project was to conduct a study to propose strategies, entry-points and approaches to strengthen free, independent, professional journalism contributing to transparency and accountability in Guatemala and possibly neighbouring countries.</narrative>
  </description>
